WEBVTT

00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:39.440
Yuma-kun! That's mine!

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:42.790
Huh?! You still don't know how to count?

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:46.570
It's three per person! 
That's your fourth one!

00:01:46.570 --> 00:01:48.710
What? Really?

00:01:49.010 --> 00:01:51.000
Um... There are more...

00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:54.460
Hey, where's Ruki-kun?

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:56.530
Weren't you going to get him?

00:01:57.390 --> 00:02:02.140
I did... but he said he didn't want any...

00:02:05.450 --> 00:02:09.410
Ruki-kun has been in a bad 
mood lately, don't you think?

00:02:09.410 --> 00:02:11.480
Yeah, he has.

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:16.070
Did something... happen?

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:26.370
I wonder what's going on...

00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:00.230
Ruki-kun?

00:03:00.230 --> 00:03:00.990
Come.

00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:02.940
Ruki-kun!

00:03:03.980 --> 00:03:05.120
Where are we going?

00:03:07.070 --> 00:03:08.450
Ruki-kun!

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:10.120
Shut up!

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:20.300
You're staying here for a while.

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:22.780
Here?

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:27.730
Why? What's going on, Ruki-kun?

00:03:57.550 --> 00:04:00.810
Ruki-kun...

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:08.530
Ruki-kun.

00:04:11.240 --> 00:04:12.860
What's with you all of a sudden?

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:17.040
We've been too lenient.

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:20.730
This is how livestock should be treated.

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:24.320
From now on, we demand even more of her blood.

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:26.970
In order to be Adam.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:31.330
Ruki-kun...

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:44.260
Hey, Ruki-kun.

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:47.890
How long are you going to keep our 
masochistic kitten locked in there?

00:04:48.340 --> 00:04:50.190
It's already been a week.

00:04:51.260 --> 00:04:54.820
We need more of Eve's 
blood for the awakening.

00:04:54.820 --> 00:04:56.870
Prey does not need freedom.

00:04:56.870 --> 00:05:01.030
Even so, you can't just 
keep her locked up forever.

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:05.650
Did you forget the promise we made with him?

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:15.840
We must become Adam.

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:18.720
But she's getting really weak.

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:23.240
If Eve is gone,

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:26.430
it'll be a problem for you too, right?

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:39.940
What has gotten into him?

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:43.020
Seriously. This is so unlike Ruki-kun.

00:05:43.020 --> 00:05:45.030
He's getting ahead of things.

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:46.820
Yeah...

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:31.600
Why?

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:35.570
Why did this happen?

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:38.940
I finally found you, Pancake.

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:44.090
Ayato-kun?! Why are you here?

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:46.880
Jeez, you're nothing but trouble.

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:48.620
Come on, we're going home!

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:52.780
W-Wait, Ayato-kun.

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:56.020
Have you been tamed by those guys?!

00:06:56.990 --> 00:06:59.190
You're my prey, and mine alone!

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:20.880
Ruki-kun! That Sakamaki guy 
took the masochistic kitten!

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:22.620
Why didn't you stop him?!

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:27.920
Don't just stand there. Answer me!

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:31.240
Shouldn't we be chasing them?!

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:33.710
Yeah! We have to get her back!

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:36.060
There's no need.

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:41.640
What do you mean?

00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:44.320
This doesn't make any sense.

00:07:50.460 --> 00:07:52.270
I don't get it, either.

00:07:56.180 --> 00:07:59.610
What now, Ruki?

00:08:02.180 --> 00:08:04.590
If we don't have Eve...

00:08:06.060 --> 00:08:07.630
We...

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:39.890
Um...

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:45.080
Give me your blood.

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:47.660
Ayato-kun... I...

00:08:47.660 --> 00:08:50.280
Shut it! I can't wait any longer!

00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:54.330
What the hell is this?

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:03.170
How much blood did you let them take?!

00:09:23.490 --> 00:09:25.500
You belong to me.

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:30.750
Don't just go and disappear on me!

00:09:31.690 --> 00:09:33.680
Ayato-kun...

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:50.350
I'll keep carving it on your 
body so you won't forget.

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:55.080
You belong to me, and only me...

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:26.550
It's time you realized, foolish human, 
just how weak you are.

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:30.850
Don't waste your time thinking, 
just obey my words.

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:35.370
If you're unable to, then I'll have 
to punish you through discipline.

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:39.840
It's time for your punishment. 
Offer your blood.
